# Directories that are never packages of this build:
#   experiments: kept by decision (2026-10-02): prototype workspaces with their own MODULE.bazel,
#     plus backend probes; not part of this build.
#   runs: agent worktrees and scratch (gitignored). Without this, a worktree checked out under
#     runs/ adds its packages to the main checkout's //... .
#   datacube/node_modules, query/node_modules: pnpm's editor install, which rules_js does not use
#     (it links packages from the lock file itself).
experiments
runs
datacube/node_modules
query/node_modules
#   .git: git's own store (a directory in a clone, a file in a worktree); its files churn with every commit in any
#     worktree, and a glob over it would make the guards' inputs (//:all_files) flake (Bazel workplan P6-00).
#   .claude: agent worktrees and settings in the main checkout; their BUILD files are other checkouts' packages.
.git
.claude
